title: '`pallet-skip-feeless-payment`: test post_dispatch paths'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds tests for the previously untested `post_dispatch` behavior of `SkipCheckIfFeeless`:
      the skip path emits `FeeSkipped` and returns zero unspent weight, the apply path forwards
      to the wrapped extension and refunds its unspent weight into `post_info`.
      Test-only, no behavior change.

crates:
  - name: pallet-skip-feeless-payment
    bump: none
